for relocation.

300
00:13:41.189 --> 00:13:43.452
But they were all there
when I left the lab last night.

301
00:13:45.846 --> 00:13:47.673
Unless...

302
00:13:47.804 --> 00:13:51.068
Unless what?

303
00:13:51.155 --> 00:13:53.244
Someone must have
swapped the EMA out

304
