469
00:20:40.216 --> 00:20:41.783
Your day's about to get worse.

470
00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:44.264
What?

471
00:20:44.351 --> 00:20:46.309
All right.
so this is Jaco Coetzee

472
00:20:46.396 --> 00:20:48.093
