502
00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:52.506
Heading to Central Park?

503
00:21:52.636 --> 00:21:54.812
No. he's walking south. actually.

504
00:21:54.899 --> 00:21:56.945
Times Square.

505
00:21:57.075 --> 00:21:59.426
